## Title: AH Fire Sale
## Notes: This plugin to Auctionator creates a Shopping List called FireSale that has items listed on the Auction House for less than their vendor price.  To populate this just do a Full Scan in Auctionator.
## Author: TimothyLuke
## Version: 0.1
## Dependencies: Auctionator
## LoadSavedVariablesFirst: 1
## SavedVariables: FireSale_Data

